{{!
    @template local_oksigeniamarandu/channel

    The channel of Telegram of the site: how to take one, or the one it has, with the posts waiting or gone out, and its
    settings without the look of a form (Jujol): every setting is a gesture of the world of the channel and saves itself.

    The settings. «What goes to the channel», each kind with its three choices; «The day of the channel», a ruler of the
    24 hours with the time of review and that of the channel and where the posts of a busy day fall, with the plates of
    the hours, the days as sheets and the pace; and, below, what is set once, in folded cards that say in one line what
    they have: the calendar, the weather warnings, the place and its sky, the links and the cards.

    Saving. Each card is a form of its own that sends only what it has (part, the card it is): the server saves what
    comes and leaves the rest. A day, a switch or a choice carries what it has now as a hidden field at the top and,
    after it, a button with the same name and the value it changes to: PHP keeps the last one. An hour or a number is
    written in its place too, before its two buttons: the first button of each form is hidden and takes the Enter of
    the fields. Text is saved with the «Save» of its card, or with any other gesture of it. The card comes back open,
    with its «Saved» (saved, open). With JavaScript, the page stays where it is: the card is sent in the background
    and replaced by the one the server draws; an hour, a number or a colour saves itself a moment after its change.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lead, saved, error - What it is for, the line after connecting and an error.
    * canconfig - Whether the user runs the site: the settings are for them; whoever only reviews sees what is waiting.
    * nobot, boturl - Without a bot, the link to its page.
    * formurl, sesskey - Where the forms go.
    * connect - Without a channel: botname and candidate (id, title, username), the channel Telegram said the bot can post in.
    * channel - With a channel: title, username, url, problem, members, growth, reviewers, noreviewers; the posts review,
      ready, published and failed (id, title, kind, when, clicks, error, urgent), and empty; kinds (name, desc, thumb,
      field, choices with value, label, on) and whatsaved; and the cards, each with key, saved and open:
      - day: marks (x, label, odd), reviewspans and postspans (a, w), planes (a, n, time), caption, the plates
        reviewfrom, reviewto, postfrom and postto (local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate), reviewdays and postdays
        (local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_day), gap, gaps (value, label, on), perday and perweek
        (local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_stepper);
      - calendar: face, line, nosource, classdays, site, weekthumb, evethumb, weekhour, evehour, ical, link, keywords;
      - weather: face, line, nofeed, levels (value, colour, on, lit, label), severity, status, feed, areas;
      - place: face, line, noplace, sky (lines), latitude, longitude, tle, tledefault;
      - links: line, utm, example, utmsource, utmmedium, shortener, hassignature;
      - cards: line, colour, theme, own, sample, org, orgdefault, animated, ffmpeg, status, previewurl; and previews
        (alt, src), the seven cards, when asked for.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lead": "What everyone may read.", "saved": "", "error": "", "canconfig": true, "nobot": false, "boturl": "#",
        "formurl": "#",
        "sesskey": "abc", "connect": {"botname": "@example_bot", "candidate": {"id": "-100123", "title": "Example school",
        "username": "@exampleschool"} }
    }
}}
<div class="local-oksigeniamarandu-wizard local-oksigeniamarandu-channel">
    <section>
        <p class="mrd-lead">{{lead}}</p>
        {{#saved}}<p class="mrd-saved" role="status">{{saved}}</p>{{/saved}}
        {{#error}}<p class="mrd-err" role="alert">{{error}}</p>{{/error}}

        {{#canconfig}}
        {{#nobot}}
        <p>{{#str}} channel:nobot, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>
        <div class="mrd-actions"><a class="btn mrd-btn mrd-primary" href="{{boturl}}">{{#str}} channel:gobot, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</a></div>
        {{/nobot}}
        {{/canconfig}}
        {{^canconfig}}{{^channel}}<p class="mrd-warn">{{#str}} channel:notconnected, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>{{/channel}}{{/canconfig}}

        {{#connect}}
        <h3>{{#str}} channel:connect, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>
        <ol class="mrd-steps">
            <li>{{#str}} channel:connect:step1, local_oksigeniamarandu, {{botname}} {{/str}}</li>
            <li>{{#str}} channel:connect:step2, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</li>
        </ol>
        {{#candidate}}
        <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-found">
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="action" value="connect">
            <input type="hidden" name="chat" value="{{id}}">
            <p><strong>{{title}}</strong> {{#username}}<span class="mrd-muted">{{.}}</span>{{/username}}</p>
            <button type="submit" class="mrd-btn mrd-primary">{{#str}} channel:use, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</button>
        </form>
        {{/candidate}}
        <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-byname">
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="action" value="connect">
            <label for="mrd-chat">{{#str}} channel:byname, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</label>
            <span class="mrd-row"><input id="mrd-chat" type="text" name="chat" placeholder="@" autocomplete="off">
            <button type="submit" class="mrd-btn mrd-second">{{#str}} channel:connectbutton, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</button></span>
        </form>
        {{/connect}}

        {{#channel}}
        <div class="mrd-head">
            <div>
                <h3>{{title}} {{#url}}<a href="{{url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{username}}</a>{{/url}}</h3>
                <p class="mrd-muted">{{members}}{{#growth}} · {{.}}{{/growth}}</p>
            </div>
            {{#canconfig}}
            <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="action" value="disconnect">
                <button type="submit" class="mrd-btn mrd-second">{{#str}} channel:disconnect, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</button>
            </form>
            {{/canconfig}}
        </div>
        {{#problem}}<p class="mrd-err" role="alert">{{.}}</p>{{/problem}}
        <p class="{{#noreviewers}}mrd-warn{{/noreviewers}}{{^noreviewers}}mrd-muted{{/noreviewers}}">{{reviewers}}</p>

        {{#review.0}}
        <h3 id="mrd-review">{{#str}} channel:waiting, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>
        <ul class="mrd-posts">
            {{#review}}
            <li class="mrd-reviewitem">{{#thumb}}<button type="button" class="mrd-thumb" aria-expanded="false" title="{{#str}} channel:review:enlarge, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}"><img src="{{thumb}}" data-full="{{full}}" alt="{{title}}" width="160" height="90"></button>{{/thumb}}
                <span class="mrd-post"><strong>{{title}}</strong> <small>{{goes}}{{#urgent}} · {{#str}} channel:urgent, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}{{/urgent}}</small></span>
                <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="post" value="{{id}}">
                    <button type="submit" name="action" value="publish" class="mrd-btn mrd-primary">{{#str}} channel:review:publish, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="submit" name="action" value="skip" class="mrd-btn mrd-second">{{#str}} channel:review:skip, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</button>
                </form>
            </li>
            {{/review}}
        </ul>
        {{/review.0}}
        {{#ready.0}}
        <h3>{{#str}} channel:next, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>
        <ul class="mrd-posts">{{#ready}}<li><span class="mrd-post"><strong>{{title}}</strong> <small>{{kind}} · {{when}}</small></span></li>{{/ready}}</ul>
        {{/ready.0}}
        {{#published.0}}
        <h3>{{#str}} channel:published, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>
        <ul class="mrd-posts">{{#published}}<li><span class="mrd-post"><strong>{{title}}</strong> <small>{{kind}} · {{when}}{{#clicks}} · {{.}}{{/clicks}}</small></span></li>{{/published}}</ul>
        {{/published.0}}
        {{#failed.0}}
        <h3 id="mrd-failed">{{#str}} channel:failed, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>
        <ul class="mrd-posts">{{#failed}}<li><span class="mrd-post"><strong>{{title}}</strong> <small>{{kind}} · {{error}}</small></span></li>{{/failed}}</ul>
        {{/failed.0}}
        {{#empty}}<p class="mrd-muted">{{#str}} channel:empty, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>{{/empty}}

        {{#canconfig}}
        <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-part mrd-que" id="mrd-what" data-part>
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save">
            <input type="hidden" name="part" value="what">
            <div class="mrd-cab"><h3>{{#str}} channel:what, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>{{#whatsaved}}<span class="mrd-sello" role="status">{{#str}} channel:stamp, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{/whatsaved}}</div>
            <ul class="mrd-kinds">
                {{#kinds}}
                <li>{{#thumb}}<img class="mrd-kindthumb" src="{{.}}" alt="" width="72" height="40">{{/thumb}}{{^thumb}}<svg class="mrd-kindthumb mrd-kindtext" viewBox="0 0 72 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="72" height="40" rx="5" fill="#f6f1e7"/><path d="M8 8h11a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v5a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-6l-4 3v-3H8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3z" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="26" y="10" width="34" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#24211d" opacity=".55"/><rect x="8" y="25" width="54" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#24211d" opacity=".3"/><rect x="8" y="31" width="40" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#24211d" opacity=".3"/></svg>{{/thumb}}<span class="mrd-kind"><strong>{{name}}</strong>{{#desc}} <small>{{.}}</small>{{/desc}}</span>
                    <span class="mrd-choices" role="group" aria-label="{{name}}">{{#choices}}<button type="submit" class="mrd-choice" name="policy[{{field}}]" value="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#on}}true{{/on}}{{^on}}false{{/on}}">{{label}}</button>{{/choices}}</span>
                </li>
                {{/kinds}}
            </ul>
        </form>

        {{#day}}
        <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-part mrd-dia" id="mrd-day" data-part>
            <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
            <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save">
            <input type="hidden" name="part" value="day">
            {{#reviewdays}}{{#on}}<input type="hidden" name="{{group}}days[{{value}}]" value="1">{{/on}}{{/reviewdays}}
            {{#postdays}}{{#on}}<input type="hidden" name="{{group}}days[{{value}}]" value="1">{{/on}}{{/postdays}}
            <input type="hidden" name="postgap" value="{{gap}}">
            <button type="submit" class="mrd-default" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
            <div class="mrd-cab"><h3>{{#str}} channel:day, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>{{#saved}}<span class="mrd-sello" role="status">{{#str}} channel:stamp, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{/saved}}</div>
            <div class="mrd-regla" aria-hidden="true">
                <ol class="mrd-horas">{{#marks}}<li class="{{#odd}}mrd-impar{{/odd}}" style="--x: {{x}}%">{{label}}</li>{{/marks}}</ol>
                <div class="mrd-pista mrd-pista-revisa"><span class="mrd-pista-n">{{#str}} channel:day:review, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                    <span class="mrd-pista-r">{{#reviewspans}}<i style="--a: {{a}}%; --w: {{w}}%"></i>{{/reviewspans}}</span></div>
                <div class="mrd-pista mrd-pista-canal"><span class="mrd-pista-n">{{#str}} channel:day:post, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                    <span class="mrd-pista-r{{#together}} mrd-apilados{{/together}}">{{#postspans}}<i style="--a: {{a}}%; --w: {{w}}%"></i>{{/postspans}}{{#planes}}<b class="mrd-avion" style="--a: {{a}}%; --n: {{n}}"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><path d="M8 31 56 10 41 52 29 39Z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".3"/><path d="M56 10 29 39 27 50 35 44"/></svg></b>{{/planes}}</span></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mrd-pie">{{caption}}</p>
            <div class="mrd-tres">
                <section class="mrd-trozo mrd-trozo-revisa" aria-labelledby="mrd-day-review">
                    <h4 id="mrd-day-review">{{#str}} channel:day:review, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                    <div class="mrd-placas">{{#reviewfrom}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate }}{{/reviewfrom}}{{#reviewto}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate }}{{/reviewto}}</div>
                    <div class="mrd-hojas" role="group" aria-labelledby="mrd-day-review">{{#reviewdays}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_day }}{{/reviewdays}}</div>
                    <small>{{#str}} channel:hours:review2, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small>
                </section>
                <section class="mrd-trozo mrd-trozo-canal" aria-labelledby="mrd-day-post">
                    <h4 id="mrd-day-post">{{#str}} channel:day:post, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                    <div class="mrd-placas">{{#postfrom}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate }}{{/postfrom}}{{#postto}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate }}{{/postto}}</div>
                    <div class="mrd-hojas" role="group" aria-labelledby="mrd-day-post">{{#postdays}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_day }}{{/postdays}}</div>
                    <small>{{#str}} channel:hours:post2, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small>
                </section>
                <section class="mrd-trozo mrd-trozo-ritmo" aria-labelledby="mrd-day-pace">
                    <h4 id="mrd-day-pace">{{#str}} channel:day:pace, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                    <p class="mrd-trozo-t" id="mrd-day-gap">{{#str}} channel:pace1, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>
                    <div class="mrd-huecos" role="group" aria-labelledby="mrd-day-gap">{{#gaps}}<button type="submit" class="mrd-hueco" name="postgap" value="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#on}}true{{/on}}{{^on}}false{{/on}}">{{label}}</button>{{/gaps}}</div>
                    <div class="mrd-pasos">{{#perday}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_stepper }}{{/perday}}{{#perweek}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_stepper }}{{/perweek}}</div>
                    <small>{{#str}} channel:pace:desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small>
                </section>
            </div>
        </form>
        {{/day}}

        <h3 class="mrd-tramo">{{#str}} channel:once, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h3>
        <div class="mrd-una-vez">
            {{#calendar}}
            <details class="mrd-plegada" id="mrd-calendar" data-part{{#open}} open{{/open}}>
                <summary><span class="mrd-cara">{{#face}}<img src="{{.}}" alt="" width="72" height="40">{{/face}}</span>
                    <span class="mrd-plegada-t"><b>{{#str}} channel:calendar, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</b><span>{{line}}</span></span>
                    {{#saved}}<span class="mrd-sello" role="status">{{#str}} channel:stamp, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{/saved}}<span class="mrd-cambiar" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} channel:change, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span></summary>
                <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-dentro">
                    <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save">
                    <input type="hidden" name="part" value="calendar">
                    {{#classdays}}{{#on}}<input type="hidden" name="{{group}}days[{{value}}]" value="1">{{/on}}{{/classdays}}
                    <input type="hidden" name="calendarsite" value="{{#site}}1{{/site}}{{^site}}0{{/site}}">
                    <button type="submit" class="mrd-default" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
                    <p class="mrd-explica">{{#str}} channel:calendar:desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>
                    <div class="mrd-cal">
                        <div class="mrd-cal-semana">
                            <h4 id="mrd-cal-class">{{#str}} channel:calendar:classdays, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                            <div class="mrd-hojas mrd-hojas-cal" role="group" aria-labelledby="mrd-cal-class">{{#classdays}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_day }}{{/classdays}}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mrd-notas">
                            <div class="mrd-nota">{{#weekthumb}}<img src="{{.}}" alt="" width="72" height="40">{{/weekthumb}}<span>{{#str}} channel:calendar:weekhour, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{#weekhour}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate }}{{/weekhour}}</div>
                            <div class="mrd-nota">{{#evethumb}}<img src="{{.}}" alt="" width="72" height="40">{{/evethumb}}<span>{{#str}} channel:calendar:evehour, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{#evehour}}{{> local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate }}{{/evehour}}</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mrd-dorso">
                        <h4>{{#str}} channel:calendar:where, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                        <button type="submit" class="mrd-llave" name="calendarsite" value="{{#site}}0{{/site}}{{^site}}1{{/site}}" aria-pressed="{{#site}}true{{/site}}{{^site}}false{{/site}}"><span class="mrd-llave-i" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{#str}} channel:calendar:site, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</button>
                        <div class="mrd-campos">
                            <label class="mrd-campo"><span>{{#str}} channel:calendar:ical, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="url" name="calendarical" value="{{ical}}" placeholder="https://" autocomplete="off"></label>
                            <label class="mrd-campo"><span>{{#str}} channel:calendar:link, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="url" name="calendarlink" value="{{link}}" placeholder="https://" autocomplete="off"></label>
                            <label class="mrd-campo mrd-campo-ancho"><span>{{#str}} channel:calendar:keywords, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="text" name="calendarkeywords" value="{{keywords}}">
                                <small>{{#str}} channel:calendar:keywords_desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small></label>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="mrd-btn mrd-primary mrd-guardar">{{#str}} save {{/str}}</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </details>
            {{/calendar}}

            {{#weather}}
            <details class="mrd-plegada" id="mrd-weather" data-part{{#open}} open{{/open}}>
                <summary><span class="mrd-cara">{{#face}}<img src="{{.}}" alt="" width="72" height="40">{{/face}}</span>
                    <span class="mrd-plegada-t"><b>{{#str}} channel:weather, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</b><span>{{line}}</span></span>
                    {{#saved}}<span class="mrd-sello" role="status">{{#str}} channel:stamp, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{/saved}}<span class="mrd-cambiar" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} channel:change, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span></summary>
                <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-dentro">
                    <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save">
                    <input type="hidden" name="part" value="weather">
                    <input type="hidden" name="weatherseverity" value="{{severity}}">
                    <button type="submit" class="mrd-default" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
                    <p class="mrd-explica">{{#str}} channel:weather:desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>
                    <h4 id="mrd-weather-level">{{#str}} channel:weather:severity, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                    <div class="mrd-niveles" role="group" aria-labelledby="mrd-weather-level">{{#levels}}<button type="submit" class="mrd-nivel mrd-nivel-{{colour}}{{#lit}} mrd-encendido{{/lit}}" name="weatherseverity" value="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#on}}true{{/on}}{{^on}}false{{/on}}"><span class="mrd-nivel-placa" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{label}}</button>{{/levels}}</div>
                    {{#status}}<p class="mrd-estado" role="status">{{.}}</p>{{/status}}
                    <div class="mrd-dorso">
                        <h4>{{#str}} channel:weather:where, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                        <div class="mrd-campos">
                            <label class="mrd-campo"><span>{{#str}} channel:weather:feed, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="url" name="weatherfeed" value="{{feed}}" placeholder="https://" autocomplete="off"></label>
                            <label class="mrd-campo"><span>{{#str}} channel:weather:areas, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="text" name="weatherareas" value="{{areas}}" autocomplete="off">
                                <small>{{#str}} channel:weather:areas_desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small></label>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="mrd-btn mrd-primary mrd-guardar">{{#str}} save {{/str}}</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </details>
            {{/weather}}

            {{#place}}
            <details class="mrd-plegada" id="mrd-place" data-part{{#open}} open{{/open}}>
                <summary><span class="mrd-cara">{{#face}}<img src="{{.}}" alt="" width="72" height="40">{{/face}}</span>
                    <span class="mrd-plegada-t"><b>{{#str}} channel:placesky, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</b><span>{{line}}</span></span>
                    {{#saved}}<span class="mrd-sello" role="status">{{#str}} channel:stamp, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>{{/saved}}<span class="mrd-cambiar" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} channel:change, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span></summary>
                <form method="post" action="{{formurl}}" class="mrd-dentro">
                    <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save">
                    <input type="hidden" name="part" value="place">
                    <button type="submit" class="mrd-default" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
                    <p class="mrd-explica">{{#str}} channel:sky:desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</p>
                    {{#sky.0}}<ul class="mrd-cielo">{{#sky}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/sky}}</ul>{{/sky.0}}
                    <div class="mrd-dorso">
                        <h4>{{#str}} channel:place, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</h4>
                        <div class="mrd-campos mrd-campos-lugar">
                            <label class="mrd-campo"><span>{{#str}} channel:place:latitude, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" name="latitude" value="{{latitude}}" autocomplete="off" data-lat>
                                <small>{{#str}} channel:place:latitude_desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small></label>
                            <label class="mrd-campo"><span>{{#str}} channel:place:longitude, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</span>
                                <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" name="longitude" value="{{longitude}}" autocomplete="off" data-lon>
                                <small>{{#str}} channel:place:longitude_desc, local_oksigeniamarandu {{/str}}</small></label>
